1
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,160
{\an8}(前情提要)

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:03,370
有人出价要买我的公寓
I got an offer on my place.

3
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:04,460
{\an8}(最佳与最终出价)

4
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,710
我们可以重新开始 寻找我们夫妻的风格
We could start over,
find our style as a couple.

5
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,500
如果我搬走 我在新家会快乐吗
If I move, how do I know I'll be happy there?

6
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:11,800
看来我们的母亲有些共通点
Sounds like our mothers
had a few things in common.

7
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,550
- 多说一点 - 这么说吧 她伤我很深
- Tell me more.
- Let's just say she did a number on me.

8
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:19,310
我先生在亚柯尼亚做过一些生意
而莱斯特曾经替他工作
My husband ran a few businesses
in the Arconia, and Lester worked for him.

9
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:21,720
莱斯特不想明说他做的事
Lester didn't wanna tell
me much about what he did.

10
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,640
他不是很喜欢那份工作
He didn't feel good about the job.

11
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:26,400
但你们认为有人杀了我丈夫
But you think somebody killed my husband?

12
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,440
- 可以请你吃晚餐吗 - 我没有证据
- Could I take you out to dinner?
- I have no evidence

13
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,110
显示你其实是好人
that you're actually a good guy.

14
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:33,820
我们其实只是一群有钱人
在争论打赌的事
We're just a bunch
of rich people hashing out a bet.

15
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:36,860
就是我们上次在赌场想解决的问题
The same one we were trying to settle
the last time we were in that gaming parlor.

16
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:41,490
你们门房死的那晚
我们赌了一笔很大的合约
The night your doorman died,
we played for a very big contract.

17
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,410
你们当中有人想盖纽约市第一间赌场
One of you is planning
to build New York City's first casino.

18
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:49,000
我想我会先开始翻修奥利佛的公寓
I think I'll start renovations
with... Oliver's apartment.

19
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,550
你在说什么
What are you talking about?

20
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,920
你收到的出价是我的
That offer on your place was from me.

21
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,010
{\an8}(卡蜜拉俱乐部)

22
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:55,680
是我要买下这里所有的公寓
I'm the one buying up
all the apartments here.

23
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,300
你要把亚柯尼亚大楼变成赌场
You're turning The Arconia
into a casino? All in.

24
00:01:08,770 --> 00:01:13,940
数千年来 男人都将运气比喻为女性
For thousands of years,
men have sung about luck being a lady.

25
00:01:16,030 --> 00:01:22,120
在《布兰诗歌》中
卡尔奥福对幸运女神深深着迷
In Carmina Burana, Carl Orff obsesses
over Fortuna, the goddess of fortune.

26
00:01:22,830 --> 00:01:25,910
法兰克辛纳屈祈求运气能当个淑女
Frank Sinatra prayed for luck to be a lady,

27
00:01:25,910 --> 00:01:29,460
却还是担心她会「对别人的骰子吹气」
but still worried she'd go "blow
on some other guy's dice."

28
00:01:30,210 --> 00:01:36,010
男人喜欢把生命中
无法控制的事与厄运都归咎于
Men love to blame anything in their life
that they can't control... their bad luck,

29
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:38,180
女人
on ladies.

30
00:01:39,390 --> 00:01:41,970
你们这些禽兽听着 下一轮我请客
Listen, you animals,
next round is on me, alright?

31
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:46,480
只要这瓶苏格兰威士忌还没老到
能跟人亲热或入伍
As long as the scotch isn't old
enough to be kissed, or drafted.

32
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:48,100
{\an8}(两年前)

33
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:49,190
糟了
Uh-oh

34
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:52,400
装潢女王注意到我的破皮革
Queen of Decor has
noticed my cracked leather.

35
00:01:53,030 --> 00:01:54,190
我人生的谷底
Worst day of my life.

36
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:56,070
更有个性了
Adds character.

37
00:01:56,780 --> 00:01:57,780
你真会说话
You're just being sweet.

38
00:01:59,110 --> 00:02:01,780
这个地方曾经风光过 滚开
Ah, this place has seen better days.
Hey, get lost.

39
00:02:01,780 --> 00:02:02,990
我知道她喜欢什么
I know what she likes.

40
00:02:02,990 --> 00:02:04,450
想来场大改造吗
Interested in a makeover?

41
00:02:04,450 --> 00:02:09,460
- 你觉得呢 浏海
还是狼尾头 - 我是指赌场 傻瓜
- What are you thinking? Uh,
bangs or a shag? - For the casino, you goof.

42
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:13,550
我可以帮忙提供女性的点缀
I could help. Give it a woman's touch.

43
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:17,550
这个点子如何
Ooh, what about this idea?

44
00:02:18,340 --> 00:02:22,350
你让我一个月在这里
办一次私人的淑女之夜
Let me host a private Ladies' Night in here.
Once a month.

45
00:02:22,850 --> 00:02:29,390
一个没有雪茄
或大嗓门的男人来搭讪的夜晚
A night without cigars...
or loud men hitting on us.

46
00:02:34,610 --> 00:02:37,530
成交 我爱淑女
Done. I love ladies.

47
00:02:38,490 --> 00:02:42,120
但别担心 除非她们有兴趣
否则我绝不会乱搭讪
But don't worry, I never hit on 'em
unless they want me to.

48
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:46,580
- 如果她们有兴趣呢 - 那我就帮她们调酒
- And if they want you to?
- Well, then, I make 'em a drink.

49
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:57,340
我们得因为一间赌场而搬走
We have to move out because of a casino?!

50
00:02:57,920 --> 00:03:01,970
你记得我为了保住公寓做出什么事吗
Do you remember what I had
to do to hold onto my apartment?

51
00:03:01,970 --> 00:03:03,510
我烧了一个人
I burned a man.

52
00:03:03,510 --> 00:03:08,600
我放火烧了一个好朋友
还买了一辆健身车
I set fire to a dear friend!
Plus, I bought a Peloton.

53
00:03:13,190 --> 00:03:14,360
你们好
- Hey! - Hi!

54
00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:17,270
看看这个可爱的地方
Look at this cute place.

55
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:19,280
天啊 是THē Oh my gosh, THē!

56
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:21,570
我在上有氧舞蹈课
Oh, I'm taking a dance cardio class,

57
00:03:21,570 --> 00:03:24,280
我们会用你的歌来搭配动作
and we're using one
of your songs for a routine.

58
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,740
我很想示范 但有太多臀部动作了
I would show it to you,
but it's got a lot of thrusting.

59
00:03:26,740 --> 00:03:29,540
- 不适合淑女 - 没这个必要
- It's not appropriate for a lady.
- Unnecessary.

60
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:31,790
梅宝贝 我的新老朋友
Mabitita, my new old friend,

61
00:03:31,790 --> 00:03:34,080
我帮你弄到今晚派对的门票
I got you and however
many plus-ones you want

62
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:35,420
你想带多少人都行
tickets to a party tonight.

63
00:03:35,420 --> 00:03:37,590
我很想去 但我们都知道我会喝醉
I'd totally come with,
but we both know I'd just get drunk,

64
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:40,970
and tomorrow I'm in a music video where
I have to operate heavy machinery, so...

65
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:40,970
明天我要拍音乐录影带
和操作重型机械 所以

66
00:03:40,970 --> 00:03:43,630
太感谢你了 我只是...有很多事要调查
Thank you so much.
I just-- I have a lot of case stuff.

67
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:48,100
不 女孩 这跟调查有关
这是不可能收到的邀请
No, chica, this is case stuff.
It's an impossible invite to get.

68
00:03:48,100 --> 00:03:50,890
是为我这种重要女性举办的淑女之夜
It's a Ladies' Night
for important ladies like moi,

69
00:03:50,890 --> 00:03:52,890
而且就在大楼里
and it's literally in the building.

70
00:03:52,890 --> 00:03:55,690
要从衣柜之类的地方进场
You get in through like--
like a closet or something,

71
00:03:55,690 --> 00:03:57,770
有点像地下酒吧 不得了
sort of like a speakeasy. Ooh-la-la.

72
00:03:57,770 --> 00:04:01,900
什么 尼奇死了耶 等等 派对是谁办的
What? But Nicky's dead.
Wait, who's throwing this party?
